REPOSITORY STRUCTURE
====================

    snap-ai/
    |
    +-- backend/
    |   +-- app/
    |       +-- config/
    |       +-- documents/
    |       +-- inference/
    |       +-- ...
    |
    +-- llama.cpp/
    |   +-- llama.cpp Git submodule
