    |   +-- README
    |   +-- local GGUF weights
    |
    +-- models.ini
    +-- .env.example
    +-- .gitignore
    +-- pyproject.toml
    +-- uv.lock
    +-- README


IMPORTANT
=========

This project is under active development.

Configuration, model assignments, ports, and architecture may change as
Workbench evolves.

When modifying the system, preserve the separation between:

    Frontend
        |
    Gateway
        |
    FastAPI orchestration
        |
    llama.cpp inference

and keep untrusted code execution isolated from the application and
host system.